<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"da0bcf2e3f060472\" href=\"?note=da0bcf2e3f060472\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-recursive.md\">../batch07/58-df-recursive.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ManyOneReducibility}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ManyOneReducibility}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reducibility} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ManyOneReducibility}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\nA\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in B)\n\\right)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reducibility} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ManyOneReducibility}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\nA\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in B)\n\\right)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Total computability is expressed by the registered, acyclic class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> together with the exact set-function signature; the former dependency through the Turing-functional cluster is unnecessary.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-recursive.md","status":"resolved","id":"da0bcf2e3f060472","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-recursive.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-recursive.md","status":"resolved","id":"da0bcf2e3f060472","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (class of total recursive numerical functions, see [[../batch07/58-df-recursive.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$（see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ManyOneReducibility}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reducibility} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ManyOneReducibility}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\nA\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in B)\n\\right)\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false}],"bytes":1353,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3235","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-recursion2-many-one-reducibility.md|58-df-zfc-recursion2-many-one-reducibility]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["da0bcf2e3f060472","36d7463d215be751","5045d216c83e75cb"]}